---
title: The Envelope — Checkout (money path)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant A as Next.js App
    participant S as Stripe
    participant W as Webhook handler
    participant DB as Supabase

    U->>A: compose letter, delivery date, recipient address
    A->>A: zod validate — horizon <= 5y, address shape
    A->>U: consent gate (unticked, required)
    Note over A,U: Art. 9 explicit consent for special-category content.<br/>Withdrawal terms depend on the goods-vs-service<br/>classification, which is still an open decision.

    U->>A: accept + submit
    A->>S: create Checkout Session (EUR 19 / EUR 29, 19% VAT)
    S-->>U: hosted payment page
    U->>S: pay

    S->>W: checkout.session.completed
    W->>W: verify webhook signature
    W->>W: encrypt letter body (AES-256-GCM, current key_version)

    W->>DB: INSERT order ON CONFLICT (stripe_session_id) DO NOTHING
    alt first delivery of this event
        DB-->>W: inserted
        W->>DB: INSERT letter (ciphertext, iv, key_version, status='scheduled')
        W->>DB: INSERT consent_log (text_version, ip, ts)
        W-->>U: confirmation email
    else replay / duplicate event
        DB-->>W: no-op
        W-->>S: 200 OK (idempotent)
    end

    Note over U,DB: If a withdrawal window is honored, cancel sets<br/>status='withdrawn', refunds via Stripe, hard-deletes ciphertext.
